{"overview":"خانواده‌ای که می‌شناسید و دوست دارید در این سری جدید حضور دارد و دسترسی کامل به زندگی‌شان می‌دهد. کریس، کورتنی، کیم، کلویی، کندال و کایلی دوربین‌ها را برمی‌گردانند تا حقیقت پشت سرفصل‌ها را نشان دهند. از فشارهای شدید ادارهٔ کسب‌وکارهای میلیاردی تا لحظات خنده‌دار بازی و تحویل کودکان به مدرسه، این سری داستانی صادقانه و جذاب از عشق و زندگی در زیر نورافکن‌ها ارائه می‌دهد.","tagline":"","overview_en":"The family you know and love is here with a brand new series, giving an all-access pass into their lives. Kris, Kourtney, Kim, Khloé, Kendall, and Kylie bring the cameras back to reveal the truth behind the headlines. From the intense pressures of running billion-dollar businesses to the hilarious joys of playtime and school drop-offs, this series brings viewers into the fold with a rivetingly honest story of love & life in the spotlight.","tagline_en":"With love,","runtime":null,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":10,"y":2022,"poster":"/3cJgB4fOfgHKNoHgtT3h1Qqkvxq.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":10,"y":2022,"poster":"/qo0xaWJuGgVj5q8kXlVoE2Ak9Z3.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":10,"y":2023,"poster":"/6mGCYwh5OMpLgTqc9Sh2RnPB7Ic.jpg"},{"n":4,"name":"فصل 4","ep":10,"y":2023,"poster":"/q1tKB9Wd88GIIfUYFgyh0PQXOCv.jpg"},{"n":5,"name":"فصل 5","ep":10,"y":2024,"poster":"/y5tqHu7Rly3RS9uJZqTTraf7mQ2.jpg"},{"n":6,"name":"فصل 6","ep":10,"y":2025,"poster":"/g1YsPdh8D49BjrS9hritndXuuKP.jpg"},{"n":7,"name":"فصل 7","ep":10,"y":2025,"poster":"/pLeSPrwEmxwaV1vqzdVfAgnUvXc.jpg"},{"n":8,"name":"فصل 8","ep":3,"y":2026,"poster":"/v61yLkV9AVIvoXDqj9wHAPNbiSL.jpg"}],"episodes":73,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"کریس جنر","role":"Self","photo":"/qPaCYMopNCF7CtFgx5GviUnKRB9.jpg","en":"Kris Jenner"},{"name":"Kourtney Kardashian Barker","role":"Self","photo":"/dE3CztdZ1leY94HP2CIEQaXnexg.jpg"},{"name":"کیم کارداشیان","role":"Self","photo":"/3TLSq0aHXyxtqaXe9p7yB5Daqsa.jpg","en":"Kim Kardashian"},{"name":"Khloé Kardashian","role"